            {
              "id": "111b8577-0243-4f18-9626-38b7b0c4819a",
              "type": "paragraph",
              "html": "<em><strong>Children's Games in Street &amp; Playground: Chasing, Catching, Seeking, Hunting, Racing, Dueling, Exerting, Daring, Guessing, Acting, &amp; Pretending</strong></em> was written by <a href=\"#/iona-and-peter-opie\">Iona &amp; Peter Opie</a>, published by Oxford University Press, November 15, 1969."
            },
            {
              "id": "230ef012-1ff8-4ccc-a1da-fdcd5dc6aebf",
              "type": "paragraph",
              "html": ""
            },
            {
              "id": "43df0e98-b2e8-4e44-bb06-a8f2e6d28c65",
              "type": "quote",
              "html": "<em>Records games played in the street, park, playground and wasteland of more than 10,000 children from the Shetland Isles to the Channel Islands. This volume focuses on games involving seeking, hunting, racing, duelling, exerting, daring, guessing, acting and pretending.</em>"
            }
          ]
